				<wikidot:authorName>Nyctibius griseus</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5051695</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>When I first read this I thought it was hilarious, and coming back to it today I still find it funny!<br /> Not to mention, I don't know if this was done intentionally, I find it ironic that nihilistic values (that stress nothing in life has value) are proposed around an anomaly that literally is a form of currency (which has material value).<br /> +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
