					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-4255061#post-3630158</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-4255061/scp-8003-j#post-3630158</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 11 Nov 2017 04:33:18 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Petrograd</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>455145</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>So it's opinionated self-important jerk who has read some philosophy and is now trying to get out of work.</p> <p>That pretty much feels like the same source of humor as <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-343-j">SCP-343-J</a>&#8230; which you also wrote&#8230; just with nihilism instead of pugnacious atheism<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-2173-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> and a less interesting framing.</p> <p>The Appolloyon misappropriation and Naismith with a fire-axe though&#8230; hmmm.</p> <p>No vote.</p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2173-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. and really we're talking two skimmed blog posts and an article about True Detective to get from one to the other.</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
